<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: xenophilia -->
  <HAR_Xenophilia.label>异族亲和</HAR_Xenophilia.label>
  <!-- EN: Relations with aliens are to be encouraged and embraced, to be fearful or hostile towards them only proves one's simplemindedness. -->
  <HAR_Xenophilia.description>我们理应与外星种族建立良好友善的关系，惧怕或敌视他们是种极其愚蠢的行为。</HAR_Xenophilia.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->[deity0_name] created a multitude of races, all a different manifestation of [deity0_possessive] perfect image.</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)  ->Our biogists catalogued and archived the multitude of [deity0_name]'s creations, which pleased [deity0_objective].</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] found the words of [deity0_name], a veritable display of open-mindedness.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->A xenophobic [foeLeader] despised the acceptance of the [memberNamePlural] community, and [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] destroyed their halls with [place_personalWeapon]s.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->A cunning [place_job] named [founderName] asked for help from members of other races to warn the [memberNamePlural] of the approach of the [foeSoldiers].</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->[founderName] spread a message of acceptance and love as divinely ordered by [deity0_name], and used it to unite all the races of the [memberNamePlural] so they could defeat the [foeSoldiers].</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->[founderName] was a social scientist in the early days of planetary colonization. Seeing the rabidly isolationist policies of many governments, [founder_pronoun] took a small ship to found [founder_possessive] own movement.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->[founderName] assembled a team of great scientists and sociologists to create a new civilization where all species could live in harmony.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->The oldest sociologist in my university taught me the history of life in the Universe, hinting that</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Xenophilia)              ->we are not alone. Intelligence is not scarce among the stars, and we are all brothers and sisters</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->Only by working all together, side by side and leaving alone our differences, may we suceed at any given task.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->What could be more accepting of our intrinsic differences than a unifying, post-singularity archotech?</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->In transcendence, our biological origins blur together.</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->[inTheEnd], all of us will achive our ascendancy by working together.</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->There is no concept of "race" amongst spirits.</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->The spirits will reveal their nature to us when we can fully accept one another as just varied manifestations of the same pure ideal.</li>
  -->
  <HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->[deity0_name]创造出了许多种族，他们都是[deity0_possessive]完美形象的不同体现。</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)  ->我们中的生物学家将[deity0_name]的众多造物进行了编录与存档，这让[deity0_objective]很高兴。</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->在[place_summary][place_name]上，[memberNamePlural]发现了[deity0_name]镌刻在地上的话语，这也是真正思想开明的体现。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Xenophilia)        ->摈斥异族的[foeLeader]鄙视[memberNamePlural]社群的包容接纳思想，并命令[foeLeader_possessive][foeSoldiers]用[place_personalWeapon]毁掉了他们的礼堂。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->一位名为[founderName]的机智[place_job]向其他种族求援，并借此对[memberNamePlural]们发出了[foeSoldiers]即将来袭的警告。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->遵循[deity0_name]的神圣指示，[founderName]四处传播着包容与友爱的信息，并将[memberNamePlural]们与所有的种族团结起来，这样便可击败[foeSoldiers]。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Xenophilia)           ->[founderName]是早期人类行星殖民时期的一位社会科学家。因不满于许多政府的极端孤立主义政策，[founder_pronoun]便驾驶着自己那挺飞船，开始四处“演奏”那属于[founder_possessive]自己的乐章。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->[founderName]组建了一个伟大的社会科学家小组，力图创立一个所有物种都能和谐共存的崭新文明。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophilia)         ->我们大学里最年长的社会学教授教给了我有关宇宙中生命的历史。他让我懂得了</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Xenophilia)              ->我们并不孤单。宇宙中的智慧种族并不稀少，我们都是和睦友爱的兄弟姐妹</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->唯有通力协作、和睦相处且摒弃异见，我们才能成功完成各种任务。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->还有什么比统合归一的超凡智能更能包容我们内在差异的呢？</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophilia)     ->在走向超越时，我们的物种起源将融合在一起。</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->[inTheEnd]，我们都将同心协力以取得优势。</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophilia)    ->在灵魂们中是没有“种族”的观念的。</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophilia) ->当我们能完全认可彼此只是同种纯粹思想的不同体现时，灵魂便能向我们揭示它的本性。</li>
  </HAR_Xenophilia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>memeAdjective->universal</li>
    <li>memeAdjective->open minded</li>
    <li>memeAdjective->accepting</li>
    <li>memeAdjective->alien loving</li>
    <li>memeLeaderAdjective->concordant</li>
