  <!-- EN: xenophobia -->
  <HAR_Xenophobia.label>异族摈斥</HAR_Xenophobia.label>
  <!-- EN: Suffer not the alien to live, their mere existence is a threat to ours. Species of such are better as our servants or our sustenance. -->
  <HAR_Xenophobia.description>我们与外星种族势同水火。他们更适合做我们的奴仆或食物。</HAR_Xenophobia.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->[deity0_name] created us, a perfect manifestation of [deity0_possessive] divine image.</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)  ->The rest of [deity0_name]'s creations were just made as tools for us, it is [deity0_objective] will that we treat them as such.</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] found the words of [deity0_name], putting us at the pinnacle of creation.</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->Jealous of our divine stature, an alien [foeLeader] tried to conquer the [memberNamePlural] community, and [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] enslaved our people.</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->A cunning [place_job] named [founderName] arose among the slaves, organizing the [memberNamePlural] to fight against the alien opressor.</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->[founderName] slaughtered the alien scum as divinely ordered by [deity0_name], and ushered the [memberNamePlural] into a new era of progress and superiority.</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->[founderName] was a social scientist in the early days of planetary colonization. Seeing the foolishly accepting policies of many governments, [founder_pronoun] took a small ship to found [founder_possessive] own movement.</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->[founderName] assembled a team of great scientists and sociologists to create a new civilization where the needs of our race take preference over the needs of disgusting aliens.</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->The oldest hunter in our squadron taught me the history of life in the Universe, hinting that</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Xenophobia)              ->we are not alone. Intelligence is not scarce among the stars and their mere existence is a threat to ours</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->There is no other way around it, the alien menace must be purged.</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->Archotechnology is the pinnacle of biological evolution, and it should only be reached by those who are truly deserving.</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->Can you imagine the threat a runaway alien post-singularity intelligence would pose to ourselves?</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->There is no other way around it, aliens must be purged before they are allowed to reach that point.</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->Aliens are soulless creatures, abominations to the world of spirits.</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->Only by getting rid of all aliens will the spirits look favourably upon us.</li>
  -->
  <HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <li>creation(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->[deity0_name]创造出了我们，我们即是[deity0_possessive]形象的完美体现。</li>
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)  ->[deity0_name]的其他造物都是为我们准备的工具，[deity0_objective]也希望我们如此对待它们。</li>
    <li>intro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->在[place_summary][place_name]上，[memberNamePlural]发现了[deity0_name]镌刻在地上的话语，这将我们置于了造物顶点的地位。</li>
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_Xenophobia)        ->因妒恨我们圣洁的地位，外星种族[foeLeader]试图征服[memberNamePlural]们的社群，并命令[foeLeader_possessive][foeSoldiers]奴役我们的人民。</li>
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->在奴隶中有一位名为[founderName]的机智[place_job]，他将[memberNamePlural]们集结起来并反抗那些外星压迫者们。</li>
    <li>victory(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->遵循[deity0_name]的神圣指示，[founderName]把这些外星渣滓尽数杀死，将[memberNamePlural]们引领向一个进步优越的新纪元。</li>
    <li>setup(tag=meme_Xenophobia)           ->[founderName]是早期人类行星殖民时期的一位社会科学家。因不满于许多政府愚蠢的包容主义政策，[founder_pronoun]便驾驶着自己那挺飞船，开始四处“演奏”那属于[founder_possessive]自己的乐章。</li>
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->[founderName]组建了一个伟大的社会科学家小组，力图创立一个我们的种族优于外星种族的文明。</li>
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_Xenophobia)         ->我们中队里最年长的猎人教给了我有关宇宙中生命的历史。他让我懂得了</li>
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_Xenophobia)              ->我们并不孤单。宇宙中的智慧种族并不稀少，而我们与他们势同水火</li>
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->我们别无他法，危险的外星种族必须被净化。</li>
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->超凡智能即是生物进化的顶峰。唯有天选之人才能引起祂的注意。</li>
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_Xenophobia)     ->你能想象到一个失控的后奇点外星种族会对我们造成怎样的威胁吗？</li>
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->我们别无他法，危险的外星种族必须在我们走向超越前被净化。</li>
    <li>animistBasis(tag=meme_Xenophobia)    ->呆板麻木的外星种族被灵魂世界所唾弃。</li>
    <li>animistProphecy(tag=meme_Xenophobia) ->唯有铲除掉所有的外星种族，灵魂们才会青睐我们。</li>
  </HAR_Xenophobia.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
